window.products.push({"id":498059,"name":"Home Traditions Pet Keepsake Frame for Dog, Cat or Other Pet Photos and Paw Imprint for Wall or Desk - Holds Two 3x3 Images & Clay Included for Imprin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71evjJKszVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cherish your furry loved one for years to come with a lasting memento of a Clay Imprint Pet Keepsake Frame. Top rated solid wood composite frame kit includes everything you need to create and display your best friends' paw print. Can work for cats and dogs! Includes no mess white clay, two 3x3\" image slots, hanging hardware for wall mounting, and easel style backing to use on desk or counter top.KEEPSAKE FRAME INSTRUCTIONS1. Turn Frame over and remove the backing from the frame.2. Place black back side down on your work surface3. Remove clay from packets and knead into a single ball4. Knead clay for 3-5 minutes on a clean surface *Remove any lint, dirt, or debris from surface before beginning as it will stick to clay*5. Place clay into cut out section of the frame, spreading it evenly with your fingers. Make sure to get all the way into the corners.6. Use a coffee mug as a rolling pin to smooth out the clay7. Place paws into clay and press gently8. Let play dry UNCOVERED for 48 hours9. Attach pictures to mat with tape10. Place mat, with images attached, on top of clay11. Place glass on top of mat12. Slip frame over the top of the entire unit and secure into place with tableOnce you've created your best friend's paw print, display on any table top, desk, or mount on wall to enjoy. Mounting hardware included. Makes the perfect gift for any friend, loved one, or family member that is pet obsessed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71evjJKszVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DII","source_asin":"B07Q396ZP7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q396ZP7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q396ZP7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
