window.products.push({"id":498064,"name":"RUN HELIX Bathroom Rugs Sets 3 Pieces Absorbent Bath Rugs, Non Slip Bath Mat Set Microfiber Machine Washable Shaggy Bathroom Floor Mats Grey Bathroom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FudG929qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤Perfect Bathroom Rugs Sets 3 Piece: Run Helix shaggy bathroom floor mats Include 1 small Bath rug 18\"x26\", 1 u-shaped toilet rug 20\"x24\", 1 large bath mat 20\"x32\" are crafted from soft and velvety microfiber, unique fiber-locking technique, thicker and better constructed than most other brands. The fluffy and soft appearance gives people the feeling of stepping into the clouds. ❤Water Absorbent Bathroom Set: The new upgraded luxury bath mat set is made of microfiber, and the moisture is trapped in the deep pile of the mat. It has strong water absorption and can quickly absorb the moisture from the soles of your feet, making your feet feel the ultimate luxury enjoy while keeping the floor dry at all times. Extra soft shaggy microfiber fabric helps save your floors from dripping water while you're stepping out of the bath, shower, or getting ready by the sink. ❤Non-Slip Bath Rugs for Bathroom: The bathroom rugs set uses the more expensive TPR Rubber backing which is much stronger and more durable, It keeps to prevent shifting and skidding, keeps shower bath rugs in place on your floors, and protects your family.Note: Please place the non-skid shower rug on a dry smooth floor only. Water under the bath rugs can cause them to slip. ❤Machine Washable Shower Bathroom Mats: Our microfiber bath mats for bathroom is easy to clean, machine wash separately with cold water and mild detergent (no chlorine or bleach) tumble dry at low speed, or hang dry. With premium fiber locking technology, every fiber is firmly attached to the backing so that the shower rugs don't fall off easily. Color will not fade and will stay vibrant for many years no matter how many times you wash and dry it! ❤Multi-Purpose: Our bathroom shower rugs with a u-shaped contour toilet mat are suitable for hotel, sauna, shower, gym for bathroom, bedroom, dining room, living room, and so on tub-side, front of the sink, and any place where you want to support and relax on your toes! A Luxury Bathroom rug set is also a satisfying gift for family and friends. Warm Tips: In our luxury bath mat set there may be creases because of folding, but will be flat after using, please do not worry. Our bath rug is non-slip and can be used for any floor surface, but please wipe the floor to dry before using, if there is water or oil under the bath rug, all of the bath rugs will be slippery, so you must keep the dry floor. If you have any questions about RUN HELIX bathroom rugs sets, please contact us, and we will reply to you within 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FudG929qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUN HELIX","source_asin":"B0C6DMHX7V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6DMHX7V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6DMHX7V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
