window.products.push({"id":498169,"name":"AIREOLUX 800 Thread Count Ultra-Soft & Silky Premium-Quality Supima Cotton Sheets - 4-Piece Long-Lasting, Moisture Wicking, Highly Breathable Sateen W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G1AVLzOlS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WORLD'S FINEST COTTON: Sink into unbelievable comfort with our 800 Thread count 100% Supima Cotton Bed Sheet Set. Supima cotton is a high-quality type of cotton which is considered to be one of the softest & strongest forms of cotton in the world. It is inherently softer & more luxurious due to its extra-long staple fiber. The length of the fiber makes for a smoother surface & produces a softer fabric that resists pilling. Hence the sheets will feel sumptuously soft & only get softer with time. CLASSIC TAILORED SET INCLUDES: FULL Set includes a 82 x 96 inches flat Sheet, 54 x 75 + 16 inches fitted Sheet, and 2 Standard Pillowcases of 20 x 30 inches. We have a PATENT in the fitted sheet called TRUE GRIP which fits mattresses up to 18 inches. These Sheets are Silky, Highly Durable & Breathable, Moisture wicking, Light Weight and Pill Proof. The Set is available in King, Queen, Full and Twin sizes. The 4\" Double Needle gives your bed an aesthetic appeal. PERFECT FIT NO POP OUTS: Addressing your needs for easy to use and snug fitting sheets, our team has created the True Grip fit technology to provide a perfect fit solution for your bed. These fitted sheets fit mattress height ranging from 7 to 18 inches. Our patented technology for fitted sheet provides 1” wide boxer elastic on the edges of fitted sheet along with ½” elastic on drop of the sheets to provide a snug fit. This ensures your sheets stays in place with varying depths of mattress. NOTHING BUT THE BEST CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE: In our quest to deliver a better sleep experience through outstanding bedding, we use the best equipment from around the world in our state-of-the-art facilities. Furthermore, our skilled and experienced employees are in control of the entire process including product development and design, sourcing of cotton, spinning, weaving, processing, cut-n-sew, and branding under one roof to have complete control of the quality in each tailor made sheet set. CERTIFICATION: Made in a vertically integrated factory certified for ISO-9001:2008, ISO-14001:2004 & ISO-18001:2007. SEDEX, OEKO-TEX and BSCI. We believe in delivering nothing less than the best quality for our customers. Machine wash, Do not bleach, Do not dry clean, Tumble dry normal, Iron medium, Dry in shade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G1AVLzOlS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIREOLUX","source_asin":"B08575NX73","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08575NX73","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08575NX73","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":498170,"name":"Flamingo P Turquoise Birds Designed Printed Blackout Curtains Grommet Panel Curtains Drapes and Curtains for Girls Room 52 x 96 Inch White Green and B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YBpT7XvlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Room Darkening Curtain is unlined, <b>Sold individually</b> Vivid Turquoise birds on the printed drape, the pattern makes Room darkening drapery more fancy. Work efficiently in insulating heat and cold outside. The panel features microfiber fabric and hangs with stylish vintage copper grommets. Inside Diameter of each grommet is 1.6'' and 2.3'' for outside diameter, so it will accommodate up to 1.5''rod. These curtains are brushed for added softness and helps to block unwanted, exterior light, reduce noise, and save energy to create the ultimate sleep environment, helps darken rooms and provides additional privacy, Nursing for Nightshift workers. Dry clean/ Machine Washable/ Mild liquid laundry detergent/ Avoid hot water and bleach/ Warm iron as desired","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YBpT7XvlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flamingo P","source_asin":"B013064PLA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013064PLA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013064PLA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
