window.products.push({"id":498277,"name":"Macrame 2 Tier Hanging Shelf - Modern Boho Wall Decor with Wooden Boards & Woven Cotton Rope - Rustic Mounted Storage for Plants, Books, Picture Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OfB-FbUkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Does your wall look empty and boring? Beautifying your home doesn’t have to mean doing intense labor and draining your savings. Sometimes a quick and easy fix can do wonders! Shelves, for example, can be incorporated easily and add an extra dimension to an unfurnished wall. If you need extra space to display your favorite items, an organizing rack for your kitchen spices, or just want a fun statement piece for your home, we’ve got just the thing for you! Our 2-tier hanging shelf strikes a perfect balance of style and functionality for your home. Spruce up your space and add a modern rustic touch with our Macrame Two Tier Hanging Shelf! Boasting a bohemian-inspired scorched wood finish, our 2-tier shelf brings the best out of anything you choose to display. You can hang it in your bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, living room, nursery, or office. It’s simple and elegant look seamlessly complements any home decor, whether you prefer farmhouse, boho, minimalist, or rustic styles. Our cotton macrame rope with bead embellishments spans up to 36” and can be adjusted depending on your needs. You can choose to hang it in a unique triangle shape or the traditional upright setup. Hang directly from the two wooden rings or from the supplied additional macrame cord lengths. The light yet ultra-durable wood panel made from the Paulownia tree has a 5.5” width and is 16.5” long. It can support most plants, succulents, picture frames, books, toiletries, cooking spices, accessories, and other little trinkets and mementos. Still not convinced? Here are more reasons to choose our wooden floating shelf: ✅ Made with the environment in mind, uses natural materials ✅ Keeps your small items neat and organized ✅ Impress your guests with remarkable craftsmanship and style ✅ Excellent gift idea for friends and family Breathe life into those empty, boring walls at home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OfB-FbUkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08QVBT7LC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QVBT7LC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QVBT7LC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
