window.products.push({"id":498439,"name":"Charger Plates Diamond Design - 13-Inch Elegant Chargers – Set of 6 - For Small to Regular-Size Dinnerware & Soup Bowls - Suitable for Weddings, Parti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BVD9qshQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a way to add some flair to your table presentation? Gone were the days when the elaborately designed charger plate was reserved for white-table events and fine dining restaurants. Now, you can own and use these right at home, and you don't need to have an occasion to bring them out. But with all the many designs out there, how do you know which one to choose? If you're looking for something simple yet sophisticated with a hint of subtle luxury, then have we got just the thing for you! Level up your table presentation with our Diamond Design Charger Plates! The subtle yet stunning rose diamond pattern of our charger plate won't take attention away from your dishes. Rather, it complements them and enhances their appeal and presentation. Using our charger plate is an excellent way of protecting your table cloth from food stains. The wide rim can catch most crumbs and morsels, and provide a barrier for your linen against soups and stews. Considering their intended purpose, it's normal for charger plates to get dirty. But don't worry, our charger plate doesn't require much effort to clean. In most cases, you simply need to rinse it with clean water and dry it with cloth before storage. For grease and oils, you'll need to use some liquid detergent. In any case, remember to never place the charger plate in the dishwasher as this may damage it. Still not convinced? Here are more features of our charger plates to help you decide: Lightweight & sturdy Perfect present for weddings and housewarming parties Non-microwavable Handwash only not dishwasher safe Add a little more flair to your meals at home. Add the Diamond Design Charger Plate to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BVD9qshQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHATEAU FINE TABLEWARE","source_asin":"B09WJHGWTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WJHGWTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WJHGWTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
