window.products.push({"id":498549,"name":"Studio Oh! Mini Box of Recipes, Chocolate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VLGcGqkwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chocolate tastes so good, it makes us feel happy and, believe it or not, can be used in ways other than sweets and desserts (really, it can!). Studio Oh!’s Mini Box of Recipes boasts 20 delicious recipes for (of course) desserts like Flourless Cake, Monster Cookies and Brownies. But did you know that entrees like Lamb Kabobs and Chicken Mole, or even BBQ Sauce get a big infusion of flavor just by adding a little chocolate? The recipes come complete with detailed instructions and an interesting and informative blurb about the recipe; each has been carefully chosen for creativity, tasty results and ease of preparation. The recipe cards are imaginatively illustrated with a whimsical vintage collage and the box is embellished with foil stamping. So, when you’re the envy of the neighborhood for your amazing BBQ ribs, are you going to share your secret ingredient? Our lips are sealed! The passionate and creative designers at Studio Oh! believe that products should not only be relevant to the needs of today’s consumers but also should be environmentally responsible, infused with energy, elevated design, richly-saturated colors and fine craftsmanship. From beautiful calendars loaded with super functional planning features, stationery and journals that move and inspire to home and kitchen accessories with plain-old-amazing designs, Studio Oh! invites you to explore their extraordinary products available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VLGcGqkwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Studio Oh!","source_asin":"B005IZOGOS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498549","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005IZOGOS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005IZOGOS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":498550,"name":"Metro Parlor Total Blackout Rustic Window Curtains Floral Printed Drapes for Bedroom Living Room, Whith Design of Blue and Navy Leaf Patterned Grommet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fxksGblFL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Ready-Made: Each package includes 2 blackout curtain panels, W52“x L95” | panel, W104“x L95” | set. Silver Metal grommets (1.6-inch inner diameter) make the curtains easy to install and slide. Completely Blackout: The triple woven fabric and black lined design make the curtain thicker and better drape to block out 100 percent of sunlight and reducing noise, offering you a good sleep during the day. Floral Print Design: Delicate floral pattern on white blackout curtains provides a nature style to help refresh and vivid your home, perfect for the living room, dining room, bedroom, and other indoor space. Energy Saving: Our heavyweight bedroom curtains help balance room temperature by insulating against summer heat or winter chill meanwhile protect privacy. Ideal for saving money on energy bills. Easy Care: Quality finishing will withstand years of use. Machine washable and wash the water temperature below 86℉. Iron and tumble dry at low heat as needed. Mild detergent no bleaching.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fxksGblFL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Metro Parlor","source_asin":"B08R1HKX79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R1HKX79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R1HKX79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":498551,"name":"Fantasy Fields Sunny Safari Animal Wooden 3 Shelves Kids Bookshelf with 1 Drawer Storage Imagination Inspiring Hand Crafted & Hand Painted Details","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":82.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ti8OWNVNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Catch Jungle Fever, with Fantasy Fields' Sunny Safari Bookcase. Three hand carved, hand painted shelves of fun, this book case is creative and unique as it is essential. Vivid colors and hand sculpted animals pop off the wood work of the book case, bringing it to life. Spacious drawer below offers room to tuck away keep sakes such as photo albums or nick nacks. With lead free paint and quality craftsmanship, this bookcase promotes education, organization, and safety. Help your child display their awards, favorite reads, and stuffed animals with this one of a kind book shelf. Some assembly required. Perfect for ages 3 and up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ti8OWNVNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fantasy Fields","source_asin":"B0C62LP8BN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C62LP8BN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C62LP8BN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":498552,"name":"Leather Refinish an Aid to Color Restorer 1 Ounce Tester Bottle (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HM-CNWhGL._AC_SL1117_.jpg","description":"From Quick Company, Leather Max The Original Leather Refinish and Color Restorer. Looks and feels like the original finish. This product is water soluble until it dries completely, which means... clean up is easy. will not rub off on clothing. waterproof. non-toxic. Because refinishing leather professionally is expensive the majority of our customers were looking to buy a product and do it themselves. Leather coats, purses, handbags, furniture and car seats all can be done now, by you. 1. Choose the color of Leather Refinish Color Restorer from the pictures here. (Not sure you can buy a 1 Ounce tester bottle from our store here) 2. Use Leather Max Refinish Color Restorer Cleaner Conditioner to thoroughly clean and prepare the surface for coloring. 3. Use the applicator to evenly apply Leather Refinish Color Restorer to the item you are refinishing and restoring color to. For Large Sofas you may need as much as 3 Jars for full coverage, available in single Jars or in the NEW Leather Max 8 Ounce Bottle from our store. All our products come with full instructions and YouTube links for information on how to apply. Please Email us with any questions..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HM-CNWhGL._AC_SL1117_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quick Company. Please look for your best color match from the pictures","source_asin":"B013XAH9IE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013XAH9IE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013XAH9IE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
