window.products.push({"id":498656,"name":"Cat Coffee Mug | Funny Stay Pawsitive Kitty Cup Ceramic Microwave and Dishwasher Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y2TfnInRL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stay Pawsitive Funny Cat Coffee Mug FOXY MUG mugs are custom created in our studio in beautiful Newport Beach, California. Our mugs are designed, produced and packaged by us and we take great pride in our products.  Our designs are permanently sublimated onto our mugs, NO vinyl or stickers are used  Our mugs are microwave and dishwasher safe and lead free  We securely package our mugs in special boxes to protect from damage during shipping  The design is printed on both sides of the mug which makes it a great option for left or right handed use Why choose FOXY MUG? We are happy to say we do not use any third party printers or mass manufacturers to make our mugs. All of our mugs are designed, printed and sublimated by us in our studio, using the highest quality sublimation inks and materials.   We have been in business since 2014 with thousands of satisfied customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y2TfnInRL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foxy Mug","source_asin":"B07D3QX53B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D3QX53B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D3QX53B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":498657,"name":"Tefal , Ingenio, Jamie Oliver, Stainless Steel, Cookware Set, Pans","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":232.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fvpqkYVDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Schönes, professionelles und langlebiges Sortiment an Kochgeschirr mit abnehmbaren Griffen aus Edelstahl, die platzsparend und vielseitig sind und für ein erstklassiges Kocherlebnis sorgen. Der abnehmbare Ingenio Griff ist ein fantastischer kleiner Helfer. Mit nur einem Klick könnt ihr eure Gerichte mühelos vom Herd nehmen und in den Ofen schieben oder zu Tisch bringen. Darüber hinaus lassen sich die Pfannen wunderbar stapeln, wodurch Sie jede Menge Platz sparen. Mit diesem induktionsgeeigneten Pfannen-Sortiment, das mit einer Antihaft-Versiegelung und dem exklusivem Tefal Thermo-Spot® ausgestattet ist, wird das Kochen köstlicher Gerichte zu Hause zum Kinderspiel. Design von Jamie Oliver: \"Jedes Gerät, das mir in der Küche praktische Hilfe leistet, ist ein Plus, und dieser Griff ist so hilfreich wie eine zusätzliche Hand. Ihr könnt die heiße Pfanne direkt aus dem Ofen nehmen, mehrere Töpfe auf den Herd stellen, ohne dass sich die Griffe in die Quere kommen, und alles lässt sich optimal stapeln. Diese beiden Bratpfannen eignen sich hervorragend zum Anbraten von Fleisch, das anschließend langsam im Ofen gegart wird, oder zur schnellen Zubereitung von luftig-leichter Frittata, die dann goldbraun aufgebacken wird. Großartig.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fvpqkYVDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tefal","source_asin":"B07XLMWCRZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XLMWCRZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XLMWCRZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
