window.products.push({"id":498682,"name":"Northlight 3' Warsaw Two-Tone Twig Artificial Christmas Tree - Unlit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nz4Pr5G2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give a realistic touch to your festive decor with this artificial Christmas tree! It is unique for its bendable twigs and rustic base. Compact in size, it is suitable for all kinds of interior spaces. Product Features:. Unlit. Warsaw twig series has a realistic, primitive look, so natural, even mother nature would be amazed. Comes with 2-tone, neutral dark brown and green tips with exposed bendable twigs. Rustic burlap base lends a country feel. No assembly required - tree comes in 1 piece. Recommended for indoor use only Dimensions: 3' high (from bottom of base to the top of the tree). Base diameter: 18\" (at the widest point) Material(s): PVC/wire/metal/plastic/burlap","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nz4Pr5G2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B076QKJC3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076QKJC3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076QKJC3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":498683,"name":"Rubbermaid Glass Baking Dish for Oven, Casserole Dish Bakeware, DuraLite 2.5-Quart, White (with Lid)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+yKIzOIvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made from premium glass designed for high heat tolerance and durability, Rubbermaid DuraLite Bakeware delivers superior baking and cooking performance. This durable yet lightweight bakeware is safe for use in oven and broiler temperatures up to 550 degrees F, and 20% lighter than ceramic bakeware. These elegant baking dishes with lids easily go from heating to serving to storing, and are break- and chip-resistant, as well as nestable and stackable for space-saving kitchen organization. This bakeware is also is BPA-free, plus microwave-, freezer-, and dishwasher-safe. This bakeware is also BPA-free, plus microwave-, freezer-, and dishwasher-safe. Use this versatile baking pan as a casserole dish, cake pan, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+yKIzOIvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rubbermaid","source_asin":"B09W8ZDP2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W8ZDP2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W8ZDP2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":498684,"name":"Cuizinette Stainless Steel Bread Knife - 8 inch Wide Long Slicer- Right Serrated for better slices - With Free PDF BONUS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AaMqhe+WL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Cuizinette is proud to present to you its STAINLESS STEEL BREAD KNIFE with serrations on the RIGHT. Do you want to be able to cut through hot bread easily? Are you fed up with knives that rust after only a few uses ? Have you just purchased a Bread Maker or a Bread Machine, whether Panasonic or otherwise, and you are looking for a knife that can deliver straight, evenly cut slices of bread to you and your family? Then look no further, our Brand New STAINLESS STEEL knife is the answer. The position of its serrations makes for an easier cut every day. Each purchase entitles you to download a FREE USER GUIDE with FREE RECIPES! Background of our Bread Knife (yes our Bread Knife has a story!): At Cuizinette we are a French family running a business to solve some of your everyday problems. As expats, one of our problems once out of France was to get our daily supply  of fresh bread every single day, just like at home. As it was not happening, we discovered the world of the bread makers and invested time and money acquiring some. We were delighted with the results but we really struggled to cut even slices of the bread it had taken so long for us (or the machine!) to make.  We then ordered countless Bread knives (including some of the best sellers on Amazon.com!) but that was to no avail. That's when we decided there must be a better way, and we designed and produced a knife with serrations on the right , which means that the bread is cut right through from the crust to the bottom from an easier side for you to handle (whether you use your right or left hand). We are so proud to make it available to you today! This is not your run-of-the-mill bread knife! With its FREE BONUS, it is a real bargain. Order yours today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AaMqhe+WL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuizinette","source_asin":"B06XJ6RLKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XJ6RLKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XJ6RLKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
