window.products.push({"id":498686,"name":"Frostfire Mooncandles - 6 Indoor and Outdoor Votive Candles with Timer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41R5eHEEDHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy candles without the messy wax and dangerous flames as well as the convenience of the remote control and timer. Flameless candles are safe to use with children and pets as well as near curtains, beds and other home furnishings. Using the automatic daily timer feature. Turn on each candle at the base of the candle. The candle will remain on for 5 hours. 24 hours after the candle was turned on the candle will turn on again for 5 hours. To stop the candle from switching on each day, switch the candle off at the base. For example: A candle switched on at 6pm will turn off 11pm. The next day the candle will automatically switch on at 6pm and turn off at 11pm. This will continue everyday until the candle is switched off at the base.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41R5eHEEDHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frostfire","source_asin":"B00NPX6MHE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NPX6MHE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NPX6MHE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
