window.products.push({"id":498905,"name":"ZenBless Ceramic Incense Stick Holder Waterfall Burner Mountain Peak Ash Catcher Tray Handmade Home Decor for Indoor Yoga Meditation","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fXVvxm9bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Zen： Mountain is the symbol of majestic and spectacular oriental culture. Placing a lighted incense cone next to the highest mountain of this censer, the smoke gently falls like a waterfall and surrounds the mountain range same as streams, creating a peaceful and mesmerizing atmosphere to mitigate your anxiety and fatigue. High-Quality Material: Made of high-quality porcelain clay, hand-shaped, fired at high temperature, The surface of purple sand pottery is delicate, smooth, and textured Non-sticky ash, look always like the new! Come with a brush, It makes them very easy to be cleaned. Great Ash Catcher: The angle of the hole in the round hole is slightly inclined towards the middle of the small mountain peaks, which makes the ash fall perfectly on the incense holder. One Holder Two Usages: This incense holder can be used with incense sticks and backflow incense cones. The incense stick can be inserted into the small hole. The backflow incense cones can be put on the small mountain peaks Smoke will drip into the incense burner like water, it's very amazing. Wide Applicable Scene: Zenbless incense holder burner is not only suitable for home, office, and hotel, but also for yoga practice, zen practice, and meditation. We strive to inspire your spiritual practice by providing various quality meditation supplies. There are lots of reasons to burn some incense, specific scents can trigger some pretty comforting, happy thoughts and encourage relaxation, increase motivation, and stimulate creativity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fXVvxm9bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZenBless","source_asin":"B0BF8QNKKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF8QNKKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF8QNKKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":498906,"name":"ZINUS No Assembly Metal Box Spring / 5 Inch Mattress Foundation / Sturdy Metal Structure, Twin, Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QKj0xk31S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Believe it or not, we’ve made the box spring more functional, more durable, and dare we even say, fun! Our No Assembly Box Spring is not your average foundation. Its folding design not only makes set-up insanely easy, but it also comes in handy on moving day, maneuvering easily in and around tight hallways and corners. What’s more, it features a structure made of thick and durable steel, meaning that frames and mattresses may come and go, but this box spring will be with you for the long haul. Once unboxed, this brilliant foundation practically assembles itself by taking shape once unfolded. Essentially, deciding where to place the bed will take longer than setting up this box spring. Backed by both our 5-year worry free warranty and hundreds of positive customer reviews, this box spring is about as easy as decisions get.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QKj0xk31S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zinus","source_asin":"B097WSVPQ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097WSVPQ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097WSVPQ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
