window.products.push({"id":498908,"name":"Ladbodun Insulated Grocery Bags Reusable Shopping Tote Cooler Bag With Zippered Top, Large Square Stand Up Food Carrier Delivery For Groceries Thermal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-yEiFq5XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【INSULATION】There are three layers of thickened insulation, making it well insulated to keep food warm and cold. With it, you can take hot food and pizza to family gatherings . You can also use it for picnics and put all your frozen items in this cooler bag. It's perfect for grocery shopping, catering and food delivery services like Uber Eats and Grubhub. ❤【REUSABLE】The inner layer is tear-resistant aluminum foil that is very tough and will not tear, the middle layer is thickened pearl cotton and the fabric is a thick 600D oxford cloth material, the bag is strong enough to hold over 50 lbs. The bag is easy to clean and washable, you can wipe the bag with a damp towel or disinfectant and dry it. It is reusable and you don't have to worry about food spills. ❤【X-LARGE】13.4 \"H x 16 \"L x 10 \"W with a capacity of 9.2 gallons. Spacious enough to hold a large amount of groceries. Designed with a small pocket on the front of the bag to fit into the luggage trolley and then placed on top of the suitcase to be pushed away without having to be picked up. Ideal for travel trips or transport, easy to carry. ❤【FOLDABLE】This bag has a divider inside so that when you go to the supermarket you can store your fruit, vegetables and meat separately. When you go on a road trip you can store snacks, drinks, wine and lunch boxes separately with the divider being removable. When you don't need to use our food bag, you can fold it up without taking up space for easy storage. ❤【STURDY】Our heavy duty food bags are sturdily constructed and can stand up and keep their shape even when filled with groceries, books, toys and other items that need to be carried. A hard bottom plate at the bottom of the bag keeps beer bottles, drinks, wine and other items upright and prevents tipping over. It makes the whole tote bag more upright and stylish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-yEiFq5XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ladbodun","source_asin":"B09RZCZ9GQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-498908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RZCZ9GQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RZCZ9GQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
